        "id": "11347283",
        "text": "\"Phew, I made it.\" \"Welcome back. You're sweating like crazy.\" \"Yeah. A guy on an electric bike was about to pass me, so I really gave it my all.\" \"And? How'd that go?\" \"I lost.\""
